    "title": "Moorhead High announces Larry Knutson retirement party - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James McCarty ,\n1 days ago Larry Knutson has broadcasted local athletics on the radio since 1975. Additionally, he has been the voice of Moorhead High athletics since 1979. Knutson announced his retirement after 51 years of broadcasting local athletics on the radio in mid-April. Moorhead Area Public Schools has announced an open house retirement party... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
